<title>GREECE: DIARY OF PROSPECTIVE SHAREHOLDERS MEETINGS.</title>
<headline>DIARY OF PROSPECTIVE SHAREHOLDERS MEETINGS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>With the equities market entering</p>
<p>the peak of the annual shareholder meetings season the following</p>
<p>is a detailed schedule of forthcoming AGMs.</p>
<p>It is updated as new AGMs are announced.</p>
<p>    COMPANY		  DATE     TIME    VENUE</p>
<p>Gener	     Jun 23   13:00   Grande Brettagne</p>
<p>Terna	     Jun 23   15:00   Meridien Hotel</p>
<p>Katselis	   Jun 23   14:00   Company HQ</p>
<p>							Loutro, Aharnes</p>
<p>Aeolian Invest   Jun 23   15:00   Holiday Inn Hotel</p>
<p>Hellas Can	 Jun 24   11:00   Hatzikonsta Found.</p>
<p>							Kifisia Ave., Marousi</p>
<p>Ekter	     Jun 24   10:30   Holiday Inn Hotel</p>
<p>Pouliades	  Jun 24   12:00   Intercontinental Hotel</p>
<p>						 *    Bonus issue</p>
<p>Elfico	     Jun 24   12:00   Company HQ</p>
<p>							Shimatari, Viotia</p>
<p>Ionian Hotels    Jun 24   14:00   Hilton Hotel</p>
<p>Hellenic Biscuit Jun 24   17:00   Company HQ</p>
<p>							Pikermi, Attica</p>
<p>						 *    Bonus issue</p>
<p>Diekat	    Jun 24   14:30   Esperia Palace Hotel</p>
<p>Fanco		Jun 24   16:00   Chandris Hotel</p>
<p>						 *    Convertible bond</p>
<p>Dias Invest	Jun 24   13:00   Commerce Chamber</p>
<p>							El.Venizelou 4, Chania</p>
<p>Xiosbank	  Jun 25   16:00   Intercontinental Hotel</p>
<p>Nireus Fisheries Jun 25   18:00   Meridien Hotel</p>
<p>Kreka		Jun 25   12:00   Galaxy Hotel</p>
<p>							Kavala</p>
<p>Minerva	    Jun 26   12:00   Company HQ</p>
<p>							Oreokastro, Salonica</p>
<p>Tasoglou	   Jun 26   15:00   Company HQ</p>
<p>							Tatoiou 112</p>
<p>							Metamorphosi</p>
<p>National Bank   Jun 26   12:00   Megaro Mela</p>
<p>General Bank    Jun 26   12:00   Grande Brettagne</p>
<p>						 *    Bonus issue</p>
<p>Papastratos	Jun 26   12:00   Amalia Hotel</p>
<p>						 *    Share conversion</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
